# review from the owners, and by .github/workflows/boundary.yml (scripts/boundary-check.php), which reads
# it from the BASE commit and refuses a pull request that changes another owner's paths without that owner's
# `boundary-approved` label. "Require review from code owners" is deliberately OFF on `main`: with one
# owner per side, an author could never approve their own pull request.
